<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5461] Visor shows wrong statistics for off heap memory</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5461</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Visor show that data is stored in Heap, while the data is in off heap:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Total: 1&lt;br/&gt;
    Heap: 1&lt;br/&gt;
    Off-Heap: 0&lt;br/&gt;
    Off-Heap Memory: 0&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;while:&lt;br/&gt;
cache.localPeek(&quot;Key1&quot;, ONHEAP) == null&lt;br/&gt;
cache.localPeek(&quot;Key1&quot;, OFFHEAP) == Value&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;reproducer is attached.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13078615">IGNITE-5461</key>
